Conditional Flow:
================
In order to handle more complex scenarios, the Spring Batch namespace allows transition elements to be 
defined within the step element. One such transition is the "next" element.
 Like the "next" attribute, the "next" element will tell the Job which Step to execute next. 
 However, unlike the attribute, any number of "next" elements are allowed on a given Step, 
 
 Note: that a single step cannot have both a "next" attribute and a transition element.

